@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Proof-producing expression-equivalence pipeline

rectangle "Live typed ExpressionIr candidates\nsource + binding context + profile" as Input #D0EBFF
rectangle "Admission boundary\ncomplete + pure + live + same profile" as Admission #FFD8A8
database "Exact operator tape\nresolved bindings + context namespace" as ExactTape #E5DBFF
database "Alpha operator tape\ndeterministic local binding slots" as AlphaTape #E5DBFF
rectangle "Bounded Replete exact graph\ncertified rules + congruence" as ExactGraph #FFE8CC
rectangle "Bounded Replete alpha graph\ncertified rules + congruence" as AlphaGraph #FFE8CC
rectangle "Complete provenance?\n<<decision>>" as Provenance #FFD8A8
rectangle "Independent iterative replay\nstructure + every atomic law" as Replay #C3FAE8
rectangle "Qualified exact pairs\ncanonical stable order" as ExactPairs #D3F9D8
rectangle "Qualified alpha pairs\nexplicit binding bijection" as AlphaPairs #D3F9D8
rectangle "Typed unsupported or limited result\nabsence is not inequivalence" as Incomplete #FFE3E3

Input -[#1971C2]-> Admission
Admission -[#C92A2A]-> Incomplete : reject / limit
Admission -[#6741D9]-> ExactTape : exact preparation
Admission -[#6741D9]-> AlphaTape : alpha preparation
ExactTape -[#E8590C]-> ExactGraph : child before parent
AlphaTape -[#E8590C]-> AlphaGraph : child before parent
ExactGraph -[#E8590C]-> ExactGraph : bounded saturation + native folds
AlphaGraph -[#E8590C]-> AlphaGraph : bounded saturation + native folds
ExactGraph -[#F08C00]-> Provenance : candidate equality
AlphaGraph -[#F08C00]-> Provenance : candidate equality
Provenance -[#C92A2A]-> Incomplete : missing / capped
Provenance -[#0CA678]-> Replay : complete proof tape
Replay -[#C92A2A]-> Incomplete : invalid proof
Replay -[#2B8A3E]-> ExactPairs : exact namespace
Replay -[#2B8A3E]-> AlphaPairs : bijection qualified

note bottom of ExactGraph #FFF3BF
Associative-commutative normalization
preserves leaf multiplicity.
Iteration stops at a fixed point or a typed cap.
end note

note bottom of Replay #E7F5FF
E-class membership is never trusted alone.
Replay uses heap frames, not native recursion.
end note

note bottom of Incomplete #FFF9DB
No result authorizes a write to MeTTaIL.
Standalone Replete remains independently owned.
end note

legend right
|= Color |= Meaning |
|<#D0EBFF>| live typed input |
|<#FFD8A8>| evidence decision |
|<#E5DBFF>| flat canonical tape |
|<#FFE8CC>| standalone Replete computation |
|<#C3FAE8>| independently replayed proof |
|<#D3F9D8>| qualified positive evidence |
|<#FFE3E3>| unsupported, incomplete, or rejected |
endlegend
@enduml
